	(text "Vin < 5.5V\nEnable voltage:\nHigh Thresh = Vref(1.24V) * (R1 + R2 + R3) / R3 = 4.092V\nLow Thresh = Vref(1.24V) * (R1 + R2 + R3) / (R2 + R3) = 3.147V"
